This developer workflow explains how to work on the WordList Writer codebase, how pipelines interact, how the backend integrates with Supabase, and how to safely add new features. It merges the original workflow with updated architecture rules, dictionary profile system, hybrid cognate window, alphabetical dictionary, cognate merging rules, and July 19 fixes to ensure stable development across all layers.
